# margins minDecisionUa=252 minTickGap=9 marginal=false
     0.0 > power on
     0.0 * power off->on
   520.1 ? relay1=nc relay2=nc outLamp3=off indLamp1=off indLamp2=off  "The following circuit and program represent the condition that if relay 1 is ON (=1) AND relay 2 is ON (=1) then light 3 will be ON (=1). Symbolically, A X B = C: ... Pushing pushbutton 1 causes relay 1 to close by providing current to the coil of relay 1. In a similar manner, pushbutton 2 controls the flow of current to the coil of relay 2. The normally open contacts of the two relays are used to effect the \"AND\" condition. Light 3 indicates when the \"AND\" condition is met—both relay 1 and relay 2 are closed (ON)."
